      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, it's just a tiny bump. i'm not really feeling nauseous or anything and i'm not losing consciousness. going to the er seems like a huge overreaction and i'm kinda scared of the cost/wait. are you sure i can't just take some tylenol and sleep it off? it doesn't feel that serious.",
